        "method": "fresh-independent-human-visual-two-pass-on-current-official-seat-chart-with-reversed-floor-and-side-order-and-independently-re-rendered-de-rotated-row-strips-at-a-different-resolution-from-an-independently-re-fetched-byte-identical-asset; independent-machine-structural-checksum-not-fed-by-the-human-range-tables: pdf-vector-divider-and-cell-geometry-with-rotation-invariant-glyph-shape-clustering; issuer-per-floor-subtotal-reconciliation; left-right-mirror-symmetry-invariant",
        "seatStructure": "matched",
